// - Mutation: custom Mutation fields (@cypher, resolvers) are not converted (compat.v7 still serves @cypher fields); with the typed client, write them as queries
// - Book.reviewCount: @cypher fields are computed by a Cypher query: not converted (compat.v7 still serves it); with the typed client, write it as a query
// - Book.averageRating: @cypher fields are computed by a Cypher query: not converted (compat.v7 still serves it); with the typed client, write it as a query
// - Book.keywords: @cypher fields are computed by a Cypher query: not converted (compat.v7 still serves it); with the typed client, write it as a query
// - Book.related: @cypher fields are computed by a Cypher query: not converted (compat.v7 still serves it); with the typed client, write it as a query
